-- §4D_NOGEO_COMPOSE (2026-08-08): elements_meta rows with no element_transforms row are IFC
-- aggregate-parent containers (Representation=None, e.g. IfcCurtainWall/IfcStair/IfcRoof) whose
-- real geometry lives on their IsDecomposedBy children. Composed here as the union AABB of the
-- children's OWN already-extracted, already-served element_transforms rows (no re-tessellation,
-- no invented value) -- traced GUID-by-GUID against the real source IFC, see
-- prompts/4D_SCHEDULE_PERFECTION.md 2026-08-08 entry. Applied client-side by _applyPendingPatch
-- (viewer/scene.js) -- never mutates the served .db file itself.
